      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Nam, quod corruerit proditor angelus, concessis merito pulsus honoribus, ardens invidia, pellere nititur quos caelo Deus advocat.",
          "english": "For he, who justly lost the honour once his own, the traitor angel, rues his lost and vacant throne, with burning envy strives to make them fall away whom God doth call to heavenly day.",
